{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。X的感受短词和细节明显更密集，尤其S01、S03、S06、S13，扫屏时容易被大量碎片分散注意力；Y左右分栏、话与感受各有位置，整体更容易快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然更费眼，但【】突出关键心理转折，感受又有大量具体、细腻的变化，并且不少内容随音乐到时出现，让观众不只是知道他难过、怀念或犹豫，还能感受到这些情绪怎样发生、变化和彼此冲突。尤其从怀念旧日亲近、重新感到孤单，到不再怪自己离开、带着想念继续生活，X的情绪层次和音乐细节衔接得更充分。Y的叙事句子更顺、更容易扫读，也更直接地交代因果，但部分感受被概括，音乐中的细微变化和人物内心的复杂程度有所损失。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "12f7ca3c-04c0-4369-9584-06b1df1eca12", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005711932011Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:57:49.202216+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a51277fc4b4982a4f319ac53ab4d12ee2b924d058a3a75f67bd1a94cb98b4fc8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42223